WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.470
<b><i>Spirit Realm</i></b>

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.980
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.410
You know about us?

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:37.600
Yes, the branded ones, 
guided by wee wings.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.490
I have been waiting for you.

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:41.770
<i>She knows about the brand?</i>

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.120
<i>Could she be an Apostle?</i>

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:45.620
<i>No.</i>

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:49.420
<i>My brand twinges. But it's different.</i>

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.910
<i>The branded ones?</i>

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.100
Granny, who are you?

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.510
Wait one moment.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:01.010
His story comes first right now.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.230
What you witnessed involves trolls?

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.140
Yes.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:08.150
Trolls normally inhabit the spirit realm.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:11.890
Even seeing them in our 
world should be rare,

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:14.900
much less a village being attacked.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.040
Wait, then...

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:20.610
Unfortunately, I cannot help you.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:21.660
Why?

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:27.410
I no longer possess the time or 
strength to leave this place.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:32.580
You make it sound like you'll 
kick the bucket any second.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:35.360
What? You're scaring me.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:36.920
Don't be so rude!

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.220
Yes, I am about to die.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.390
I am quietly waiting for 
my time to come.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.930
Then what should we do?

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.310
Not to worry.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:52.650
I cannot go, but I will send 
someone in my stead.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:56.110
Schierke, aid them.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.020
Oh, that's a big responsibility!

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.010
Mistress, but I'm not...

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:04.240
It's time for you to apply your 
training out in the world.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.120
But right now?

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:09.520
Could you all aid my apprentice?

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.650
Hey, we don't owe you that much.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.040
Sorry to say it, but we're in a rush.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:18.880
Of course there will be recompense.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:24.640
I shall make a ward that will protect 
you during your journey.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.980
What's a ward?

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.430
A protection charm.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.630
A protection charm?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.830
Don't you just buy those 
for peace of mind—

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:31.680
Watch your tongue!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.770
Wards made by mages are 
no mere superstition!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.150
The ones my mistress makes 
are exceptional!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.130
Ignorant masses wouldn't understand.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.240
Well, sorry for being ignorant.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.540
The brand has power beyond imagining.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.690
It is not possible for me 
to nullify it completely,

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:50.040
but I can weaken it.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.990
It will attract fewer evil spirits,

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:56.170
and it should no longer 
be able to possess you.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.750
You can do that?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.800
However, the ward's effect 
will not last forever.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:07.140
Still, it should last for the 
duration of your journey.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.020
<i>It can prevent that from happening?</i>

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.900
I see.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.520
I didn't know the brand had 
that kinda thing going on.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.010
I'll accept your offer.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.450
We have a deal, then.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.150
Thank you.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:28.780
Hey.

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:32.080
This is getting pretty interesting.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.850
She should just leave them!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.200
Mistress...

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.290
You should address your 
new companions.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.840
Thank you for allowing 
me to join you.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.580
Well, Schierke, prepare supper.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.350
Draw an herbal bath, too.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.520
Yes, mistress.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.870
You must all be exhausted 
from your long journey.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:56.500
Please depart in the morning, so that 
you can have a good night's rest.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:00.800
This mansion has also been warded.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.440
I can guarantee you safety 
for at least one night.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.430
With so many leaves and berries,

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:11.650
I don't feel like I'm eating 
anything, but it's good.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.910
It's nutritious.

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.710
Granny, what did you 
mean when you said

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.230
you were waiting for us?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:23.540
I had a prophecy from a 
friend in the spirit realm.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:29.150
He said that branded ones, guided by 
wee wings, would come to the forest,

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:32.170
and that I should aid them.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.280
But I'm the one being aided by you.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.890
It has turned out rather contrarily.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.730
Aid us...

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.150
Who was it?

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.390
Hey, so what's this spirit realm about?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.400
Put simply, it's the afterlife.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.870
Due to the brands' power,

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.050
you've all become attuned

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:56.420
to incorporeal entities, 
invisible to the naked eye.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.240
There is a trinity of realms.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:03.060
The mortal realm coexists with, 
and overlaps, two others.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.620
One is the spirit realm,

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.290
an astral plane that belongs to spirits.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:11.520
The other is realm of ideas. 
The soul of existence's origin.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.400
So basically, they're ghosts?

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:18.030
They seem a little too real. 
They're all sticky and gross.

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:21.650
That's because your spiritual self 
is interacting with the spirits.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.410
If your spiritual self senses them,

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:27.490
your physical self will react when 
you see and touch them

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.100
as if they had material form.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.660
Then, does that mean...

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:35.660
Elves and trolls are both denizens 
of the spirit realm.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:40.640
In the past, the existence of 
elves was widely accepted.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:46.210
But as the Holy See's monotheistic 
world view has spread,

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.500
fewer humans could see them.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.730
Once humans became 
unable to sense elves,

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:54.420
most of them vanished 
into the spirit realm.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.030
I see.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:59.440
So that's why Farnese couldn't 
see me at first.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.290
You should savor my presence.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.670
Please don't bully her too much.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.370
Your so-called homeland 
had better be safe.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.150
And not in the afterlife.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.310
No prob, no prob.

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:12.910
We have lots of live humans, 
so it's probably fine.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:17.560
We mages have long practiced 
freeing our spiritual selves

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:22.010
from the physical realm, in order 
to explore the astral realm.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.920
You can do that?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:28.080
There is a plane of existence 
in the relatively shallow

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.440
reaches of the spirit realm 
called the interstice.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.890
There, many spirit beings 
of legend reside.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.080
Souls of the dead who haven't

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:39.780
realized their death, or given up their 
ties to the living, wander there.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:42.460
Deeper in the spirit realm,

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.960
the landscape is quite unlike 
the physical realm,

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.720
beyond your wildest imagination.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:51.890
Massive astral beings exist there,

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:54.690
beside which human spirits pale.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:08:00.480
Those we call angels and demons, 
or in polytheistic societies, gods.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.090
And in the greater depths,

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:06.360
worlds may exist that humans only reach

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.920
through their own karma, 
such as heaven and hell.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.940
Traveling too far may prevent return,

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.690
so no one has reached those depths alive.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:20.680
Beyond, in the farthest reaches, 
it's possible that...

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.470
Not only is the world vast without,

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.550
it also contains great depths within.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:33.380
The world cannot be defined by 
materialism or any single doctrine.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.580
To accept that great mysteries exist,

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:38.730
and to explore all creation 
from within our world...

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.700
That is the way of mages.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.880
Come on, stay still.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.550
The journey's damaged your hair.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:02.980
I never thought I could relax 
like this during a journey...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.520
Not to mention, at a witch's home.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.280
Well, time to exercise my 
special rights as a kid.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:15.780
Shit!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.240
Scrub-a-dub-dub...

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.950
Take that! And that!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.950
Ow... Ow.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:20.570
And that!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.940
You wish to show me something?

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:22.770
And that.

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.220
What is it?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.750
That's...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.250
<i>What is that?</i>

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.990
Where did you get that?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:33.900
I obtained it from a man.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:35.690
I see.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:40.590
All those who aim to master 
magic know of it.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.530
It is a Behelit.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:45.640
It's a key, linking the mortal realm and 
the deepest part of the spirit realm.

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:49.400
A talisman used to summon five angels.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.010
Good thing you're a witch. 
I have less to explain.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:59.320
So tell me how to use this 
to get them to show up.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.720
Is it for revenge?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.260
Hey, wait!

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.080
Don't walk around like 
that. It's indecent.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.440
Please excuse us!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:15.710
To protect her, you are headed 
to Elfhelm. Isn't that right?

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:17.470
<i>Elfhelm?</i>

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.470
So you know everything.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.470
There is a paradox.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:25.180
Without hatred, you would not be alive.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:31.080
Yet those vengeful flames threaten to 
engulf the thing you care for most.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:36.990
That, in turn, has shackled you, 
dulling the edge of your sword.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:41.490
Unfortunately, I cannot help you.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.820
Then you won't teach me how?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.760
No.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.930
This is not what you think.

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:52.720
It isn't something you can use 
by learning a technique.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.570
A high-ranking astral being, capable of

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.770
determining human fate, or an 
even more powerful entity,

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.960
sends a Behelit to the physical realm.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:06.120
It finds its way into a chosen one's 
possession, at a chosen time.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.940
That is how it works.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:13.690
When it will be used is 
beyond human control.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.820
It's up to God, then?

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.070
Not a fan.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.780
Oh, wait a minute!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.570
Don't take my Betty out without asking.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:23.600
It's yours now, is it?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.170
Yeah. I mean, I'm the 
one looking after it.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.330
One more question.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.180
The God Hand...

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.830
Who are they?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.710
Even to we who traverse 
the spirit realm,

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.020
that is one of the great mysteries.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:41.840
All I know is that they 
were all once human.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:45.700
Reincarnated as executors of the will

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:51.040
of an unknown entity, residing in 
the spirit realm's deepest reaches.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.070
I doubt any human can reach

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:59.750
those depths without losing 
their spiritual sense of self.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.990
Talk about clutching at shadows.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.520
I am sorry to be of so little help.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:10.510
It's fine. I'm still counting 
on you for the ward.

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:12.120
I'm going to go bathe.

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:16.740
Well, good luck to you tomorrow.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.630
That's... a brand of sacrifice, isn't it?

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.510
My mistress taught me about them.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.870
Those who have been marked

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.020
become an offering to dark beings, 
down to their last breath.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.860
You intend to take on beings

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:35.400
who can manipulate fate, 
such as angels and demons?

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.400
I guess.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.520
I have to punch them 
in the face someday.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.160
What is it, Schierke?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:50.040
It's idiotic. He's so ignorant.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:54.710
Emotion and feelings 
are critical in magic.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:59.760
But we're speaking of transcendental 
beings in the physical realm!

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.420
I've seen him.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:05.920
He possessed an enormous flow of od, 
which engulfed and entranced people.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.940
A fortune that denied any 
physical blade's touch.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.250
A hawk...

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:15.550
He may look human, but his 
spiritual form is far greater.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.990
In the physical realm, 
none can equal him.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.440
He is, indeed, absolute.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:26.480
If he is the fifth angel incarnate, 
as prophesized in Revelations,

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.200
the Hawk of Darkness,

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:30.200
that is terrifying.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:34.960
That hawk is the one who branded him.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.630
Then even more reason...

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.830
Schierke,

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.850
we mages possess more knowledge

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:45.350
than most humans regarding the 
forces that reside in this world.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:50.180
But that knowledge may, 
at times, obscure the truth.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.930
What do you mean?

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.200
Do not let yourself be beguiled 
by hidden miracles.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:59.750
Open your eyes and see the 
truth before you, as well.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.440
He is still alive.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.950
He has resisted fate and lived.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.240
Lived to meet Schierke,

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.200
the witch of the forest of the 
spirit tree's favorite disciple.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.960
Are you instructing me to help him?

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.710
That is your decision to make.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:22.080
The gods may mete out fate to men,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.160
but the choice to accept that 
fate still lies in their hands.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:26.970
That is my belief.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:30.060
Use your eyes and decide for yourself

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.970
what this fateful encounter 
means for you.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.900
There.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:45.450
Ow!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.600
What the hell?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.320
I rubbed in purifying salt.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.830
It's done.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.060
While the ward isn't as 
strong as my mistress's,

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:56.290
it should keep the brand from attracting 
evil spirits for a day or two.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.580
I'm counting on it.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.580
Are the rest of you ready?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.300
This kind of stings.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.090
What is this ointment?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.090
It isn't for eating.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.310
This is called witch's ointment,

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.250
a kind of numbing medicine made 
by combining almond oil with

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.370
celery, belladonna, aconite, 
and other ingredients.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.180
By dulling the five senses,

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.100
it improves your ability to 
sense spiritual beings.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.830
There.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:18.850
What are they?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.860
Magical weapons from my mistress, 
imbued with the blessings of spirits.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.480
With these, you should be 
able to counter trolls.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.990
First, Serpico, take this 
hooded cloak and sword.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.520
What is special about this cloak?

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.500
It seems to move of its own accord...

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.280
Take a good look at it.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:37.460
Oh?

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.500
I see something faint...

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.120
Perhaps the shadows of 
translucent-winged insects.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:45.500
Yes, they're sylphs, air elementals.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.540
Elementals...

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.480
In the physical realm, the material 
states we observe,

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:55.030
such as solid, liquid, energy, and gas,

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.070
resonate in the spiritual realm

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:01.030
with earth, water, fire, 
and air elementals.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:04.980
These elementals are the air's 
spirits filling this world.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.930
The very heart of the wind 
flowing in the skies.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.240
Huh, so you're the wind.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.490
Thanks for your work. I'm Puck.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.780
What're you saying?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.240
They're our ancestors.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.350
Huh?

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:18.920
You're a pixie, right?

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:22.070
Don't you know pixies 
belong to air spirits?

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.250
There are all kinds, but...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.520
I was an air spirit?!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.700
That's a shocking revelation!

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.420
I wasn't a chestnut!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.370
The sylph cloak is blessed 
by the elementals.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:37.630
It allows you to use air to ward yourself 
against swords and arrows.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.030
This sylph sword has also 
been blessed by the wind.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:42.910
Its blade is a great eagle's feathers,

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:46.250
and its hilt is of mistletoe from 
the forest's highest branch.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.370
With one strike, you can 
create a whirlwind

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:52.050
to rend the flesh of enemies 
without touching them.

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:54.440
It looks kind of lame.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:01.410
Ta-dah.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.320
This is useful.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.100
We're invincible.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.180
Nice, nice!

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:06.600
Where's mine? Where's mine?

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.920
This is for you.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.160
Huh, a dagger?

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.590
Why can't I get a sword or spear?

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:16.410
Oh, but it's glowing kind of red.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.800
What're these small, wriggly things?

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:19.950
Lizards?

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.630
They're salamanders, fire elementals.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:28.180
Molten lava was transformed 
into this blade by magic.

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:32.940
Any wound caused by this dagger 
will burn as if caused by a brand.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.990
Huh...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:35.700
There!

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:39.140
Salamanders are a rowdy bunch!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.860
Please stop swinging it around.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.950
This is great.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:43.970
And what's this?

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.460
Consecrated berries.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.830
Throwing them at trolls 
will make them flee.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.540
That's a good fit for you.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.650
They're only for self-defense.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:55.840
I would prefer not to bring a reckless, 
thoughtless person such as you,

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.090
but I cannot disobey my mistress.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.000
What was that?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.880
Please try not to get in 
the way like before.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.710
Y-You've got to be kidding me...

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.470
Now, now.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.540
The same goes for you.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.810
Farnese, please give Casca 
the silver shirt.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:12.020
When you use these items,

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.010
please envision their astral forms,

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.470
as you see them now, 
as clearly as possible.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:20.820
They are only as strong as your 
belief in their astral power.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.320
And once you've used them,

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:26.070
please don't forget to 
thank the elementals!

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:30.830
They will aid you even more if there 
is greater trust between you.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.220
Thank you, all.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.180
Lastly, this is for you, Guts.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.310
I don't need it.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.180
Aw, why not? Just take it.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.180
How dare you reject our help?

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.100
In battle, I prefer to stick 
with what's familiar.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.310
The sun's already up.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.730
Let's get going.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.730
Hey, where's mine? 
Where's my super slasher?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.480
Cut it out.

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:58.470
<i>What is that?</i>

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:04.120
I've never seen a tree so large.

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.710
Huh?

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:08.830
All the scrapes and bruises 
I had yesterday are gone.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.210
Come to think of it...

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.480
Your physical bodies readjusted 
to your ideal spiritual forms.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:17.540
Staying here heals most 
minor and new wounds.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.720
How useful.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.600
This is in the spirit realm.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:27.170
The interstice straddles the 
physical and spirit realms.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:31.500
The power of the brand situates 
you in the interstice in the

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:35.260
physical realm, where you can 
sense the spiritual realm.

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:38.830
You could say it's like being 
at the water's edge.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:43.560
Still, unless the mistress of the 
house extends an invitation,

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:46.410
normal people can never come here.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:50.900
Since you were on the house's 
plane, you easily reached it.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:52.930
Then this place is...

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.910
In the afterlife, I suppose.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:57.840
We apparently had a near-death 
experience without realizing it.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:02.210
In the physical realm, this tree fell 
nearly two hundred years ago.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:06.000
When it was alive, 
arboreal animists worshiped it.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:10.320
The more elevated the life 
in the physical realm,

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.730
the more permanence in the 
spiritual realm after death.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:18.640
Many mages choose to 
live in the interstice.

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:22.070
The restrictions that hold sway in the 
physical realm are weaker here,

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:26.760
so it becomes easier to manipulate 
reality with the power of thought.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.860
Master mages can even 
fly through the skies.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.920
Seriously? Sounds like a stretch.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:38.740
Mistress, may we not leave Casca 
here safely, at least?

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.860
I appreciate the gesture,

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:44.920
but leaving her behind 
has never ended well.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.220
But...

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.330
I know this place is safe,

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.930
but nothing is ever certain.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:54.440
So I prefer to keep her where 
my sword can protect her.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:59.260
Yes, that is the path you've chosen.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:03.450
That may protect you from 
the vengeful flames.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:06.380
Have you also made peace 
with this path, miss?

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.470
I am going.

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:10.670
I may be more of a burden, though.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.580
I'm trusting you with Casca.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.080
R-Right!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.260
<i>What a burden.</i>

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.590
<i>If I went alone, it would be easier.</i>

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.340
Okay, let's get going!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.590
<i>Especially that one.</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.720
Well, I shall be off.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:32.980
May the spirits' blessings be with you.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.770
I'll take care of her.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.860
Oh, so you were here.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.490
You could have spoken to them.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.540
Is this to your liking?

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:02.670
Even so, I must wonder 
at this turn of events.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:05.130
To think that you would 
ask a favor of me.

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:07.630
And for someone else, at that.

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.030
Old friend,

00:22:10.030 --> 00:22:14.890
I would like to believe that you 
still have a human heart...

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.540
It may not matter if I do it personally.

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:23.150
He may only be a factor, 
guided by the law of causality.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:24.910
Indeed.

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:31.180
God has allotted him a certain fate. 
The fate of encounters.

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:39.790
It's no use, Hannah! He's done for!

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:41.170
Ted...

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:53.100
Damn it!

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:04.660
Everyone!

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:08.030
Morgan, you're alive!

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:09.280
I managed, somehow.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:11.180
Wh-Where are the rest?

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:14.310
Well, trolls attacked us in the forest...

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:15.660
I see.

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:18.550
Who are in the coffins?

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:20.190
Ted and Horace.

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:22.170
They took Hannah.

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:25.250
They attacked Ted, who was 
guarding the cattle shed,

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.420
and took Hannah when 
she tried to save him.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.450
A mob showed up

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:33.390
when Horace defended his sister by 
stabbing one with a pitchfork.

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:34.930
They tortured him to death!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:38.900
He was just married four days ago.

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:42.900
So, Morgan, how did things go for you?

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:46.430
Elder, they are our help.

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:48.190
Heya!

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:50.280
So they are the ones...

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.590
<b>I'm counting on you, spirits!!</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>They can't be dealt with 
by human means!</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>Doing something you don't want to, 
just because you're told to, is weak.</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>Trolls! But why so many?!</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>They mean to overwhelm 
and devour us.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.020
<b><i>Next Episode 
Fight for Survival Against 
the Demonic Legion</i></b>
